<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:9%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B><I>Hazardous Materials</I></B>&#148; means any pollutant, chemical, substance and any toxic, infectious, carcinogenic, reactive,
