&#147;<B><I>Parent Balance Sheet Date</I></B>&#148;) provided to the Company prior to the date of this Agreement. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:9%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B><I>Parent
Benefit Plan</I></B>&#148; has the meaning set forth in <U>Section</U><U></U><U>&nbsp;3.17(a)</U>. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:9%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B><I>Parent Board</I></B>&#148;
means the board of directors of Parent. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:9%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B><I>Parent Common Stock</I></B>&#148; means the Common Stock, $0.0001 par value per
share, of Parent. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:9%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B><I>Parent Common Stock Consideration Cap</I></B>&#148; has the meaning set forth in
<U>Section</U><U></U><U>&nbsp;1.5</U>. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:9%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B><I>Parent Common Stock Consideration Cap</I></B>&#148; has the meaning set forth in
