 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:9%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B><I>Parent Convertible Preferred Stock</I></B>&#148; means Parent&#146;s <FONT
