<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:9%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B><I>Parent Covered Person</I></B>&#148; means, with respect to Parent as an &#147;issuer&#148; for purposes of Rule 506 promulgated
under the Securities Act, any Person listed in the first paragraph of Rule 506(d)(1). </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:9%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B><I>Parent Data</I></B>&#148; means all
data and information Processed by or for Parent or any of its Subsidiaries. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:9%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B><I>Parent Disclosure Schedule</I></B>&#148; has the
