<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The undersigned Holder hereby irrevocably elects to convert the number of shares of Series A <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">Non-Voting</FONT> Preferred
